# README.md is deliberately NOT ignored: pyproject.toml declares `readme = "README.md"`, so
# hatchling needs it in the context to build the wheel, and the Dockerfile COPYs it for that
# reason. Excluding it fails the build at `COPY pyproject.toml uv.lock README.md ./`.
